          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "The complete entry supplies bytes and length but has no path that changes stream initialization."
        }
      ],
      "comparison_reason": "Both versions support the same default gzip output. The same fixed deflateInit call prevents gzip initialization on both sides.",
      "missing_information": [],
      "change_ids": ["g0001", "g0002"]
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "gzip_custom_header",
      "necessary": "yes",
      "necessity_reason": "The compression stream supports caller supplied gzip header fields. The harness cannot select gzip wrapping or install a header for any fuzz input.",
      "before": {
        "requirement": "Emit caller supplied gzip header fields on a gzip wrapped deflate stream.",
        "applicability": "required",
        "harness_status": "unsat",
        "reason": "Gzip wrapping and deflateSetHeader provide the setup, and deflate emits the supplied fields. The harness uses only the default zlib initializer and never sets a header.",
        "source_evidence": [
